[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6170045809","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124422#issuecomment-6170045809","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124422","id":6170045809,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABb8NtcQ","user":{"login":"Schnorg","id":44937651,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0OTM3NjUx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/44937651?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Schnorg","html_url":"https://github.com/Schnorg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Schnorg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Schnorg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Schnorg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Schnorg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Schnorg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Schnorg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Schnorg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Schnorg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Schnorg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-14T13:56:00Z","updated_at":"2026-10-14T13:56:34Z","body":"I just posted a proposal as a place to discuss/present new 4.x API for this.\r\n\r\nDespite my strong desire to not expose new API, I am struggling to see another way to make things 'just work' while not closing the door on console quality performance. It's hard to be sure that automatic waking coudn't create wake-up-storms in some high end scenarios as @jrouwe mentioned.\r\n\r\nI also proposed the naming `wake_adjacent_bodies()`. It looks like Juan himself may have written the existing`wake_neighbours()` function with UK spelling? This makes me uncertain as to whether US or UK spelling is the winner here for ESL?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6170045809/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6170451311","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124422#issuecomment-6170451311","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124422","id":6170451311,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABb8mdbw","user":{"login":"lawnjelly","id":21999379,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxOTk5Mzc5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/21999379?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly","html_url":"https://github.com/lawnjelly","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-14T14:15:43Z","updated_at":"2026-10-14T14:30:04Z","body":"Juan did indeed add UK spelling `wake_neighbours()`.\r\n\r\nI've snuck in a few UK spellings before as I'm from the UK :grin:, but generally Godot is standardized on US spelling (it's in the contribution docs somewhere I think).\r\n\r\nAs such, `wake_neighbors()` would be fine for API (i.e. deciding to use a different term shouldn't be based on the US / UK difference here).\r\n\r\nWith API (and naming in general) I personally find the first obvious thing that pops in your head is normally a solid starting point (unless logical reasons otherwise).\r\n\r\nIncidentally I had a look at how other physics engines handle all this. It seems manual waking is quite common:\r\n\r\n### PhysX (Unity & Unreal)\r\nDoesn't automatically wake the old and new AABBs, you have to do it manually.\r\n\r\n### Jolt\r\nAs @jrouwe mentioned has `BodyInterface::ActivateBodiesInAABox()` (which is what we are doing under the hood in Bullet, just limited to the single body).\r\n\r\n### Box2D\r\nAuto wakes up islands when a contact is removed via teleportation, however there's a note that when teleporting a static body away from a sleeping rigid body can result in floating artifacts requiring manual `b2Body_Awake` flags.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6170451311/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6339818209","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124422#issuecomment-6339818209","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124422","id":6339818209,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABeeHy4Q","user":{"login":"lawnjelly","id":21999379,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxOTk5Mzc5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/21999379?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly","html_url":"https://github.com/lawnjelly","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-22T11:38:52Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T11:38:52Z","body":"UPDATE: Now that #124687 has been merged I've removed that from this PR.\r\n\r\nI've also removed the auto-wake for the previous AABB, so this PR is more focused (that feature can easily be added in a follow up if desired).","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6339818209/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6357197481","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124422#issuecomment-6357197481","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124422","id":6357197481,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABeusiqQ","user":{"login":"Schnorg","id":44937651,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0OTM3NjUx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/44937651?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Schnorg","html_url":"https://github.com/Schnorg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Schnorg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Schnorg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Schnorg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Schnorg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Schnorg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Schnorg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Schnorg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Schnorg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Schnorg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-23T04:12:50Z","updated_at":"2026-10-23T04:12:50Z","body":"Is this feature still needed? \r\n\r\nAre there issues that haven't been fixed with the #124687 merge? \r\n\r\nMy MRP for waking issues is working fine now with Bullet. ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6357197481/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]